        <activityName xml:lang="en">Waste separation system, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Waste separation system, at plant
na;
UUID: 3c1d2286-76ff-3d3e-97e1-0422ccca85d9
This data set includes the materials and resources needed for producing one kitchen waste separation system per unit. The waste boxes are made from polypropylene. The weight is 3 kg. Transport to the production site is included. Excluded are transport to the construction site and mounting. Expected lifespan is 15-20 year. 80% is recycled at the end of life.; Geography: Data valid for Switzerland
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average production
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3c1d2286-76ff-3d3e-97e1-0422ccca85d9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
